{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfZYg6wdeCdqK6ztph54F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, DR-9001 has been decided. It is recorded as decision DEC-2026-0001, dated 2026-09-23.\n\n- **Outcome:** Approved with authorization (APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION). Sarah Chen can only approve discounts up to 10%, so the 15% request needed a VP Sales sign-off.\n- **Approved by:** Michael Torres, VP Sales, on 2026-09-24. The knowledge graph has no dated role facts for him, so I couldn't confirm his title for that date separately. His role comes from the decision record.\n- **Policy:** Northstar Pricing Policy 2026 and its Approval Authority Matrix (APP-MATRIX-2026).\n- **Eligibility basis:** Acme's Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025) §3.2 and a pricing exception in its Schedule B (EXC-ACME-NS500-15). That exception allows up to 15% on the NS-500 only, from 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31. It replaced an earlier 2023 exception that capped the discount at 10% (EXC-ACME-NS500-10). The request was a contract exception, and Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) was matched to the ERP account C-1001, Acme Mfg. Holdings.\n\n```json\n{\"decided\": true, \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION (approved; 15% discount on NS-500)\", \"approved_by\": \"Michael Torres (VP Sales), 2026-09-24\", \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026 / Approval Authority Matrix APP-MATRIX-2026\", \"eligibility_basis\": \"Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 §3.2 and Schedule B pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (NS-500 only, max 15%, valid 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\"}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":661,"cache_read_input_tokens":5756,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":661},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":nu